{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0114_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a7f8a774cc164e7c6ac7907981765f9badb2030eee73c4415f1380ac9d9738e1", "ja": "（今日は可憐の衣装合わせだ。さすがに\nウェディングドレスともなると、きらびやかだな！）", "zh": "（今天是可怜试穿新服装的日子。\n婚纱这类服装果然华丽得不得了啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0114_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f5d29015b695623f64559324e041b030ac4e21431f398ec830d99541b5842154", "ja": "可憐、どうだ？　調整が必要なところとかあったら、\n遠慮なく言ってくれ。", "zh": "可怜，你觉得怎么样？\n如果有哪里需要调整，你尽管说别客气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0114_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "8d215d94db834e5056ef9b097d0cb2ef1b10214a5c8e980596219ba828542fe0", "ja": "い、いえ、大丈夫です……。\n魔法みたいに、私の体にぴったりです……！", "zh": "没、没有，没问题的……\n感觉就像施了魔法一样，跟我的身体非常吻合……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0114_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "b381713a39dd0853135aa1273602388efe2829fc661ad09337cd90a105e9b876", "ja": "それに、もしサイズが合わなくても……か、体を\nドレスに合わせるよう、がんばりますから……！", "zh": "而且，就算尺寸不合……\n我、我也会想办法让身体穿得下它的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0114_1004_p", "source_sha256": "234423356ed790e4af6b5f029e03171bda31a755cb0001cba62a8424bbc269fa", "ja": "いや、その場合は言ってくれ……\nステージで動く時に危ないからな。", "zh": "别这样，觉得不合就要跟我说……\n不然在表演时容易发生意外喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0114_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "c8a7a6033e6c32a40ba0378c3ed36dc081a25ff3d189f93b2614b041e7cb7fb6", "ja": "あ、そ、そうですよね……私、なんだか\nおかしなこと言ってますよね……うぅ……。", "zh": "啊，说、说得也是呢……\n我好像说了奇怪的话……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0114_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e87b2642e5eab5cd8a022818b68fab5d560864b4c991807657b8b3fc5bff68ee", "ja": "というか、普段の衣装合わせより緊張してるような……\nウェディングドレスだからか？", "zh": "是说你好像比平常试衣服时还要紧张……\n是因为这是婚纱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0114_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "6813f664ddd8c6f7f83bee798485f25c6458094f0208b0118fc0bc3cb2223bf8", "ja": "そ、そうですね、ウェディングドレスなので……\nそのせいかも、しれません……。", "zh": "说、说得也是，毕竟是婚纱……\n或多或少也有些关系吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0114_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "657cdcd13a4def3d2893bda841fc7647fb0297fc32e767ada076c2bccf5530e2", "ja": "この衣装も、すごく繊細ですし……\n着替えるときは、細心の注意を払いました……！", "zh": "这套服装非常细致……\n在更衣的时候，我有格外小心……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0114_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f575130c1c52180701f4ddd684619b108d8b695dc55eb12823b79bf687c31a8a", "ja": "そんなにか……確かに繊細だけど、衣装だし。\nもっと、楽にして大丈夫だよ。", "zh": "这么夸张啊……细致归细致，但它终归是服装，\n你再放轻松点没关系的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0114_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "7a5a0ccf74f0ae87222eace36b63bcca29f3299e74ffb85dc45a1e14fc4a2fd1", "ja": "でも、私、ただドレスを着ただけなのに、\nこんなに緊張してしまって……。", "zh": "是说我只是换上婚纱，\n就紧张成这副德性……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0114_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "8e8328aa36b92522713ad94ee12970b4142dab3e62b6389102788d4342a41bbc", "ja": "お……お仕事の時は、どれだけ大変なことに\nなっちゃうのかって考えると……。", "zh": "工……工作的时候，根本不晓得\n会紧张成什么样子，一想到这，我就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0114_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0114_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c08c96ec7360b8be6080b88143969cb1539e9f86bbb7db44ff7d22857c49e94e", "ja": "そんなに心配しなくても大丈夫だよ。\n可憐なら、本番も必ずうまくやれるはずだ。", "zh": "用不着那么担心。\n我想可怜在正式开拍时肯定也会有好表现的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
